                    847.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The Fund shall continue to provide permanent part-time employees who are expected to be in active pay status at least 50% of the time every pay period medical plan benefits, supplemental benefits and other benefits as determined and extended by the Fund. In addition, it shall provide 50% dependency coverage where the dependents of the employee qualify. Such employees shall contribute an amount determined by the Fund's Trustees toward the cost of coverage. Enrollment and continued coverage in Fund benefits is further subject to the following conditions:",
            "block_bbox": [
                137,
                848,
                1084,
                1011
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
